# upstream-agent example environment file.
#
# IMPORTANT
# ---------
# Never put your API token in .env or commit it anywhere.
# Tokens live in your config file (default: ~/.upstream/config.yaml),
# which is gitignored by this repo.
#
# This file documents the OPTIONAL environment variables the agent reads.
# Copy to ".env" only if you need to override defaults locally.

# Override the default config path (~/.upstream/config.yaml).
# UPSTREAM_CONFIG=/absolute/path/to/your/config.yaml

# Override the log level (debug, info, warning, error).
# UPSTREAM_LOG_LEVEL=info
